<style>
  .bl-science {
    background: #E8F2F1;
    padding: 80px 40px;
  }
  .bl-science-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .bl-science-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .bl-science-header h2 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0C3B3F;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .bl-science-header p {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #5A5550;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Two-column grid */
  .bl-science-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Image column */
  .bl-science-img-col {
    position: relative;
  }
  .bl-science-img-col img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    object-fit: cover;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    display: block;
  }
  .bl-science-badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    background: rgba(12, 59, 63, 0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }
  .bl-science-badge-stat {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #C07840;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .bl-science-badge-label {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.8);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Content column */
  .bl-science-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  /* Science cards */
  .bl-science-cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .bl-science-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #DDD6CC;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bl-science-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: #C07840;
    border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;
  }
  .bl-science-card h4 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #0C3B3F;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .bl-science-card p {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #5A5550;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Bullet box */
  .bl-science-bullets {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    margin: 0;
    background: #0C3B3F;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .bl-science-bullets li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.9);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .bl-science-bullets li .bl-bullet {
    color: #C07840;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bl-science {
      padding: 56px 20px;
    }
    .bl-science-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .bl-science-img-col img {
      aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    }
    .bl-science-badge {
      position: relative;
      bottom: auto;
      left: auto;
      right: auto;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .bl-science-badge-stat {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    .bl-science-header h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>

<section class="bl-science">
  <div class="bl-science-inner">
    <div class="bl-science-header">
      <h2>The Science Behind NAD+</h2>
      <p>NMN isn't a stimulant. It supports what your body already makes — but produces less of as you age.</p>
